    "poseAdaptation": "Locally baked source-model poses, not game-captured GIFs. One whole walk cycle over 32 frames; zombie leg amplitude35deg uses source variable.tcos0=25deg; villager source amplitude40deg. Walking is sampled by distance as source, at a chosen display period1.28s. Whole model translated per frame to align footbaseline308.",
    "miniatureIntegration": "Draw zombie at~65–75logical pixels tall versus regularPvZ112; retain NEAREST raster sampling. Villager is a brown-robed original classic villager model, not modern biome-overlay model.",
    "limitations": "Original Minecraft Wiki entity renders were inaccessible403. Baked pose selection simplifies full gameplay animation controllers to walking, unarmed zombie attack and villager hold/walk. Villager idle is the actual folded-arm held pose."
